WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:08.128
In this video, you will sponsor your installer company, so it stands out at the top of the map list, in the installer list, or both.

00:00:08.128 --> 00:00:11.441
We go as far as the secure payment page, and stop there.

00:00:11.441 --> 00:00:12.603
We start on the map.

00:00:13.502 --> 00:00:17.564
To begin, open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:17.564 --> 00:00:19.689
That is the only address you need.

00:00:22.602 --> 00:00:25.009
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:25.009 --> 00:00:28.753
The first time you visit, it asks to use your location.

00:00:28.753 --> 00:00:30.090
Tap Use my location.

00:00:31.861 --> 00:00:36.298
That is how the map shows how far things are, and gives you directions.

00:00:36.298 --> 00:00:39.503
Your browser asks permission as well, so tap Allow.

00:00:39.503 --> 00:00:44.064
Your location is used only on your device, and you can say no at any time.

00:00:46.812 --> 00:00:50.182
Look at the top right corner of the map, and tap the three dots.

00:00:52.183 --> 00:00:54.427
In the menu, tap Promote your event.

00:00:54.427 --> 00:00:56.429
This page is for paid placements.

00:00:58.387 --> 00:01:00.349
At the top, tap See all pricing.

00:01:02.297 --> 00:01:03.669
Scroll to Installers.

00:01:03.669 --> 00:01:06.475
Paid placements are always labelled Sponsor.

00:01:06.475 --> 00:01:10.341
The Banner is a pill in the strip at the top of the map list.

00:01:10.341 --> 00:01:14.270
Top of the list puts your company first in the installer list.

00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:15.143
Or take both.

00:01:15.143 --> 00:01:16.889
The prices are on this page.

00:01:17.788 --> 00:01:19.367
Under Banner, tap Choose.

00:01:21.403 --> 00:01:25.688
If you are not signed in, it asks you to sign in with your company email.

00:01:25.688 --> 00:01:27.367
Your company is picked here.

00:01:27.367 --> 00:01:29.104
It needs a free profile first.

00:01:30.005 --> 00:01:34.059
These are the three plans: Banner, Top of the list, and both together.

00:01:34.059 --> 00:01:37.770
Your choice is marked, and each one lists everything it includes.

00:01:39.802 --> 00:01:42.408
Below is a summary with the exact dates.

00:01:42.408 --> 00:01:46.031
It starts today, and ends on the last day of the season.

00:01:46.031 --> 00:01:48.002
Automatic renewal is optional.

00:01:48.002 --> 00:01:52.261
It is off unless you tick this box, and you can cancel it any time.

00:01:53.163 --> 00:01:55.128
Then tap Continue to payment.

00:01:55.128 --> 00:01:57.289
This opens Stripe's secure page.

00:01:57.289 --> 00:02:03.510
We stop here, because this is only a demonstration, and we never enter card details in a video.

00:02:05.812 --> 00:02:11.081
After you pay, your placement turns on within a few minutes, and a receipt arrives by email.

00:02:11.983 --> 00:02:14.849
That is how you sponsor your installer company.

00:02:14.849 --> 00:02:19.386
Every paid placement is labelled Sponsor, and renewal is always your choice.

00:02:20.786 --> 00:02:22.791
Next up: Add an event to the map.
